429
00:24:29,752 --> 00:24:32,626
Dia bicara padaku, dan itu agak, um...

430
00:24:32,627 --> 00:24:33,542
Hangat?

431
00:24:33,543 --> 00:24:35,501
Ramah. Ramah?

432
00:24:35,502 --> 00:24:37,502
Tidak. Tidak. Aku mengerti.

433
